title: "Coherent Time Theory (TCT)"
abstract: >
  Coherent Time Theory (TCT) proposes a coherence-based description of time,
  introducing a scalar coherence field whose dynamics reproduce known physical
  limits while predicting experimentally testable correlated temporal fluctuations.
